{"fileVersion":"1.0","metadata":{"title":"Lionel Template v1 Trial 01","description":"First authoring regression trial of Lionel Template v1 using a user-supplied transcript that closely matches Observation 06.","graphId":"lionel-template-v1-trial-01","version":"0.1.0","kind":"graph","created":"2026-08-07T15:13:00.000Z","modified":"2026-08-07T15:13:00.000Z","author":"","tags":["lionel","template-trial","v1","regression"],"preferredViewer":"https://twilite.zone"},"nodes":[{"id":"lionel-v1-trial01-declaration","type":"declaration","label":"Lionel Template v1 Trial 01","root":false,"position":{"x":-980,"y":-780},"width":460,"height":340,"ports":[{"id":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":210}],"visible":true,"showLabel":true,"data":{"identity":{"graphId":"lionel-template-v1-trial-01","name":"Lionel Template v1 Trial 01","version":"0.1.0","description":"Regression authoring trial of Lionel Template v1.","createdAt":"2026-08-07T10:13:00-05:00","updatedAt":"2026-08-07T10:13:00-05:00"},"intent":{"kind":"graph","scope":"template-trial"},"declaration":{"kind":"graph","targetMode":"artifact","artifactKind":"graph","defaultSurfaceId":"root","surfaces":[{"id":"root","kind":"port","label":"Lionel Template v1 Trial 01","portNodeId":"lionel-v1-trial01-home","viewNodeId":"lionel-v1-trial01-home"}]},"dependencies":{"nodeTypes":["declaration","port","markdown"],"portContracts":["core"],"schemaVersions":{"nodes":">=1.0.0","ports":">=1.0.0"},"optional":["github://mikemartinez1974/public/templates/lionel/v1/root.node","github://mikemartinez1974/public/graphs/observations-on-lionel/observation6.node"]},"authority":{"mutation":{"allowCreate":true,"allowUpdate":true,"allowDelete":true,"appendOnly":false},"actors":{"humans":true,"agents":true,"tools":true},"history":{"rewriteAllowed":false,"squashAllowed":false}},"templateInstance":{"templateRef":"github://mikemartinez1974/public/templates/lionel/v1/root.node","templateVersion":"0.1.0","trialKind":"regression","sourceObservationRef":"github://mikemartinez1974/public/graphs/observations-on-lionel/observation6.node","sourceTranscriptName":"Pasted text(20260807-151311).txt"}}},{"id":"lionel-v1-trial01-home","type":"port","label":"Lionel Template v1 Trial 01","root":false,"position":{"x":-420,"y":-780},"width":760,"height":350,"ports":[{"id":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":210}],"visible":true,"showLabel":false,"data":{"identity":{"graphId":"lionel-template-v1-trial-01","portId":"root","name":"Lionel Template v1 Trial 01"},"view":{"intent":"node","payload":"node.web.summary","label":"Lionel Template v1 Trial 01"},"renderShape":{"kind":"markdown"},"markdown":"# 🎙️ Lionel Template v1 · Trial 01\n\n## Regression trial: Live Associative Synthesis\n\nThis transcript closely matches **Observation 06**, so it is not a held-out generalization test. It is useful as the first authoring regression test for the v1 grammar.\n\n**Container:** `live-lionel-owned`  \n**Sequence controller:** `live-thematic-thread`  \n**Navigation:** `branch-and-return`  \n**Persistent state:** `thread-set`  \n**Audience:** interactive  \n**Media:** referenced/described, not source-playback-led\n\n**Verdict:** the vocabulary fits cleanly. The main problems are authoring ergonomics, not missing ontology."}},{"id":"lionel-v1-trial01-source","type":"markdown","label":"Source Basis","root":false,"position":{"x":-980,"y":-300},"width":560,"height":420,"ports":[{"id":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":210}],"visible":true,"showLabel":false,"data":{"identity":{"graphId":"lionel-template-v1-trial-01"},"templateRole":"source-provenance","sourceType":"transcript","duration":"~1:23:00","renderShape":{"kind":"markdown"},"markdown":"# 📄 Source Basis\n\nUser-supplied transcript, approximately **1:23:00**.\n\nThe episode opens with a chaotic political/social-media frame, quickly introduces Candace Owens, Tucker Carlson, Laura Loomer, Trump, Israel/Iran, and the Charlie Kirk/Tyler Robinson dispute, then moves into a thematically integrated preparedness sponsor.\n\nLater it contains the self-description `you notice how I go back and forth`, repeated explicit return operations, audience comments, research-network discussion, coalition history, and a community-style Sunday close.\n\nClaims about people, elections, criminal cases, foreign policy, motives, blackmail, evidence, and institutions remain attributed to the speaker or quoted audience participants. This graph models structure, not truth status."}},{"id":"lionel-v1-trial01-config","type":"markdown","label":"Episode Configuration","root":false,"position":{"x":-350,"y":-300},"width":590,"height":460,"ports":[{"id":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":210}],"visible":true,"showLabel":false,"data":{"identity":{"graphId":"lionel-template-v1-trial-01"},"templateRole":"episode-configuration","containerMode":"live-lionel-owned","sequenceController":"live-thematic-thread","navigationMode":"branch-and-return","audienceMode":"interactive","mediaMode":"referenced-media","renderShape":{"kind":"markdown"},"markdown":"# ⚙️ Episode Configuration\n\n## Container\n`live-lionel-owned`\n\n## Sequence controller\n`live-thematic-thread`\n\n## Navigation mode\n`branch-and-return`\n\n## Audience mode\n`interactive`\n\n## Media mode\n`referenced-media`\n\n## Dominant support structures\n`thread-set` · `actor-field` · `research-funnel` · `coalition`\n\nThis is a clean use of the v1 axes. No new episode family is required."}},{"id":"lionel-v1-trial01-map","type":"markdown","label":"Episode Map","root":false,"position":{"x":310,"y":-300},"width":760,"height":720,"ports":[{"id":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":210}],"visible":true,"showLabel":false,"data":{"identity":{"graphId":"lionel-template-v1-trial-01"},"templateRole":"episode-map","renderShape":{"kind":"markdown"},"markdown":"# 🗺️ Episode Map\n\n## 0:00–5:39 · Alarm Hook + Thematic Sponsor\n`Frames` → production `thematic-sponsor-transition`\n\n## 5:39–14:41 · Catch-Up Narrative + Chat Branches\n`Adds Context` + `Incorporates Audience` + explicit `branch-and-return`\n\n## 14:41–25:40 · Turning Point + Scenario Simulation\nOctober 7 becomes the turning point in Lionel's account; an imagined private Trump conversation supplies a `Simulates Scenario` beat, with explicit uncertainty about the hidden cause.\n\n## 25:40–39:52 · Messenger Audit + Actor Field\nTed Cruz, Huckabee, Dershowitz, Shapiro, Barnes, Tucker, Candace, MTG, Massie, Joe Kent, and others are evaluated by current usefulness and alignment. `Maps Actors` is the stable operation.\n\n## 39:52–50:54 · Foreign-Policy Motive Model\nLionel models Netanyahu's incentives and explicitly distinguishes empathy from sympathy. `Models Another Perspective` fits directly.\n\n## 50:54–58:04 · Research Funnel + Legal Countermove\nCandace, Baron, anonymous contributors, tips, image/video analysis, filtering, and possible defense follow-up form a `Research Funnel`.\n\n## 58:04–1:07:34 · Cross-Ideological Curation\nUseful analysis is selected across old left/right boundaries. `Maps Actors` + `Synthesizes`.\n\n## 1:07:34–1:16:08 · Historical Coalition Model\nDixiecrats, religious right, constitutionalists, Tea Party, Second Amendment groups, and libertarians become the analogy for a new coalition.\n\n## 1:16:08–1:23:00 · Community Synthesis + Ritual Close\nAudience identity, country/world values, family, music, programming, subscriptions, `stay weird`, and recurring signoff."}},{"id":"lionel-v1-trial01-structures","type":"markdown","label":"Shared Structures Used","root":false,"position":{"x":-980,"y":520},"width":680,"height":650,"ports":[{"id":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":210}],"visible":true,"showLabel":false,"data":{"identity":{"graphId":"lionel-template-v1-trial-01"},"templateRole":"shared-structures","renderShape":{"kind":"markdown"},"markdown":"# 🕸️ Shared Structures Used\n\n## Thread Set\nPersistent threads: political realignment; Trump transformation; Israel/Iran/U.S. policy; Candace/Charlie/Tyler; new actor field. Temporary branches include chat jokes, probiotics, sauerkraut, Barnes/Viva updates, farm produce, and music.\n\n## Issue Scope\nPrimary question: **What happened to the old political alignment, and what coalition or worldview is forming in its place?** Nested questions concern Trump's change, actor alignment, Tyler Robinson evidence, and the relationship between crowd research and formal investigation.\n\n## Actor Field\nPeople are organized by current functional alignment and issue-specific usefulness rather than permanent party identity.\n\n## Research Funnel\n`contributors → tips / image-video analysis → filtering → promoted lead → possible investigator follow-up`\n\nA tip entering the funnel is not automatically an Evidence Item.\n\n## Coalition\nThe late historical analogy and present actor field fit `Coalition` cleanly. The important relationship is `alignsOn(issue)`, not generic `agreesWith`."}},{"id":"lionel-v1-trial01-moves","type":"markdown","label":"Lionel Operations Used","root":false,"position":{"x":-230,"y":520},"width":650,"height":620,"ports":[{"id":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":210}],"visible":true,"showLabel":false,"data":{"identity":{"graphId":"lionel-template-v1-trial-01"},"templateRole":"lionel-operations","operations":["frames","states-thesis","performs-issue-analysis","adds-context","analogizes","simulates-scenario","models-another-perspective","maps-actors","synthesizes","qualifies","incorporates-audience"],"renderShape":{"kind":"markdown"},"markdown":"# 🧠 Lionel Operations Used\n\nThe trial uses the existing compact palette without adding an operation:\n\n- `Frames`\n- `States Thesis`\n- `Performs Issue Analysis`\n- `Adds Context`\n- `Analogizes`\n- `Simulates Scenario`\n- `Models Another Perspective`\n- `Maps Actors`\n- `Synthesizes`\n- `Qualifies`\n- `Incorporates Audience`\n\n`Comments on Media` is not central because the transcript references and describes media but does not establish a sustained play/pause/resume source-led sequence.\n\nThat negative fit is useful: an available class need not be instantiated."}},{"id":"lionel-v1-trial01-production","type":"markdown","label":"Audience and Production","root":false,"position":{"x":490,"y":520},"width":650,"height":600,"ports":[{"id":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":210}],"visible":true,"showLabel":false,"data":{"identity":{"graphId":"lionel-template-v1-trial-01"},"templateRole":"audience-production","renderShape":{"kind":"markdown"},"markdown":"# 💬 Audience + 🎬 Production\n\n## Audience roles exercised\n`triggersBranch` — probiotic joke and other side routes  \n`suppliesLead` — Barnes/fundraiser and current-information updates  \n`corrects` — context and factual-detail clarification  \n`proposesHypothesis` — possible explanations for political behavior  \n`buildsRapport` — moderator praise, greetings, jokes, music and family talk\n\n## Production events\n- alarm-style cold open\n- thematically integrated prepper sponsor\n- moderator acknowledgment\n- live-chat incorporation\n- possible later programming\n- community close\n- ritual like/subscribe/bell/signoff\n\nThe production layer remains cleanly separate from the argument ontology."}},{"id":"lionel-v1-trial01-postmortem","type":"markdown","label":"Template Trial Postmortem","root":false,"position":{"x":1210,"y":520},"width":780,"height":700,"ports":[{"id":"root","label":"root","direction":"bidirectional","dataType":"any","angle":210}],"visible":true,"showLabel":false,"data":{"identity":{"graphId":"lionel-template-v1-trial-01"},"templateRole":"trial-postmortem","verdict":"clean-regression-fit","newOntologyRequired":false,"authoringDefects":["missing-class-backed-episode-anchor","missing-shared-structure-classes","missing-semantic-edge-classes"],"renderShape":{"kind":"markdown"},"markdown":"# 🧪 Template Trial Postmortem\n\n## Fit\n**Clean regression fit.** No new episode family, navigation mode, analytical primitive, or Lionel operation was required.\n\n## What worked\n- independent configuration axes describe the episode naturally\n- `Thread Set` captures persistent stories plus temporary branches\n- `Actor Field`, `Research Funnel`, and `Coalition` recur naturally\n- broad Lionel operations with role values prevent class explosion\n- audience roles cover several chat behaviors\n- unused media-reaction machinery can remain absent\n\n## What was awkward\nThe **ontology fits better than the authoring experience**. Draft v1 names the vocabulary, but it does not yet provide real authoring classes. Every instance in this trial still has to be expressed as primitive Markdown plus `data.templateRole`.\n\nConcrete defects:\n1. `Lionel Episode` / configuration should become a real class-backed anchor.\n2. Stable shared structures such as `Thread`, `Issue Scope`, `Actor Field`, `Research Funnel`, and `Coalition` need reusable node classes or imported shared classes.\n3. Stable relationships such as `belongsToIssue`, `relevantTo`, `triggersBranch`, `returnsTo`, and `alignsOn` need semantic edge classes.\n\n## Limitation\nThis is **not a held-out test**. It closely matches Observation 06, which helped create the grammar. It validates internal consistency and authoring direction, not generalization.\n\n## Verdict\n**Grammar: strong. Authoring package: still skeletal.**"}}],"edges":[{"id":"lt1-e0","type":"reference","source":"lionel-v1-trial01-declaration","target":"lionel-v1-trial01-home","sourcePort":"root","targetPort":"root","label":"default surface","data":{"semanticRole":"default surface"}},{"id":"lt1-e1","type":"reference","source":"lionel-v1-trial01-home","target":"lionel-v1-trial01-source","sourcePort":"root","targetPort":"root","label":"source basis","data":{"semanticRole":"source basis"}},{"id":"lt1-e2","type":"reference","source":"lionel-v1-trial01-home","target":"lionel-v1-trial01-config","sourcePort":"root","targetPort":"root","label":"configured as","data":{"semanticRole":"configured as"}},{"id":"lt1-e3","type":"reference","source":"lionel-v1-trial01-config","target":"lionel-v1-trial01-map","sourcePort":"root","targetPort":"root","label":"maps episode","data":{"semanticRole":"maps episode"}},{"id":"lt1-e4","type":"reference","source":"lionel-v1-trial01-config","target":"lionel-v1-trial01-structures","sourcePort":"root","targetPort":"root","label":"uses structures","data":{"semanticRole":"uses structures"}},{"id":"lt1-e5","type":"reference","source":"lionel-v1-trial01-map","target":"lionel-v1-trial01-moves","sourcePort":"root","targetPort":"root","label":"uses operations","data":{"semanticRole":"uses operations"}},{"id":"lt1-e6","type":"reference","source":"lionel-v1-trial01-map","target":"lionel-v1-trial01-production","sourcePort":"root","targetPort":"root","label":"contains production","data":{"semanticRole":"contains production"}},{"id":"lt1-e7","type":"reference","source":"lionel-v1-trial01-structures","target":"lionel-v1-trial01-postmortem","sourcePort":"root","targetPort":"root","label":"tested by","data":{"semanticRole":"tested by"}},{"id":"lt1-e8","type":"reference","source":"lionel-v1-trial01-moves","target":"lionel-v1-trial01-postmortem","sourcePort":"root","targetPort":"root","label":"tested by","data":{"semanticRole":"tested by"}},{"id":"lt1-e9","type":"reference","source":"lionel-v1-trial01-production","target":"lionel-v1-trial01-postmortem","sourcePort":"root","targetPort":"root","label":"tested by","data":{"semanticRole":"tested by"}}]}